cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "phylodonor: phylogeny-guided donor grafting for protein thermostability"
abstract: >-
  A configuration-driven pipeline that identifies thermophilic homologs of a
  target enzyme, ranks them as donors of stabilising structural elements, and
  uses a protein language model to prioritise chimeric designs before
  structural and dynamical validation.
type: software
